sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Guest
    participant API as Booking Service
    participant DB as MySQL

    Guest->>API: Request cancellation quote
    API->>DB: Read booking policy and payment
    API->>API: Calculate refund and cancellation fee
    API->>DB: Save quote valid for five minutes
    API-->>Guest: Show refund amount and terms
    Guest->>API: Confirm cancellation
    API->>API: Recheck quote under database locks

    alt Quote expired or terms changed
        API-->>Guest: Ask guest to review a fresh quote
    else Quote valid
        API->>DB: Cancel booking and release rooms if required
        API->>DB: Save refund obligation or review or no-refund decision
        API->>DB: Save events and commit all changes together
        API-->>Guest: Booking cancelled with refund status
    end
